WEBVTT

00:01.500 --> 00:03.000
Paradise Audio. 17 free plug-ins for Logic Pro.

00:03.200 --> 00:08.000
Engine 909. Twelve drum voices, all synthesised.

00:08.100 --> 00:11.000
Drag a pattern up or down, onto another drum.

00:11.300 --> 00:15.000
Pick a genre. Sixteenths, or thirty-seconds.

00:15.100 --> 00:19.000
[Afro House]

00:19.300 --> 00:27.000
The Compressor has a duck. It pumps on the beat. Halves, quarters, eighths, sixteenths.

00:27.200 --> 00:30.800
Voice Box. Eight vocal effects, in one rack.

00:30.800 --> 00:32.400
[A real voice, dry]

00:32.400 --> 00:36.000
[Autotune, harmony and reverb from Voice Box]

00:36.300 --> 00:40.200
Seventeen plug-ins for Logic Pro. Free.
